s=\"token operator\">></span> OUTPUT_FILENAME\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">-- Restore</span>\nmysql <span class=\"token operator\">-</span>u root <span class=\"token operator\">-</span>p DB_NAME <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> SQL_FILE_NAME\n</code></pre></div>","frontmatter":{"title":"MySQLよく使うコマンド","date":"November 17, 2025","post_modified":"November 17, 2025","description":"MySQLよく使うコマンド忘れないようにメモ","tags":["MySQL"],"draft":false}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/Infrastructure/mail_dmarc/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"サイト上のメールフォームなどからメールを送信する際の迷惑メール判定"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/Tools/windows/excel_shortcut/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Excelショートカット"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"7370b152-8b12-5a79-a1a4-eefd44da4566","previousPostId":"51e137c7-1cc0-505d-a5da-b0f03b7a6650","nextPostId":"4abd2b52-f8d1-578e-bb7e-9cf2a2ff9f45","draft":false}},"staticQueryHashes":["1126706167","1176493165","1188992244","1314910092","1760060771","2772418575","3679674316"]}